WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:06.132
Open Expenses from Home. You can enter a purchase manually or scan a receipt. This is

00:06.132 --> 00:10.583
a record of what you enter, not a connection to your bank account.

00:15.400 --> 00:20.964
For manual entry, review the amount, currency, store and purchase date. Check the

00:20.964 --> 00:26.733
decimal places carefully. Save after the details agree with the purchase you want to

00:26.733 --> 00:27.214
record.

00:30.400 --> 00:35.545
If you scan, compare the total and currency with the original receipt. Correct

00:35.545 --> 00:40.953
misread names, prices or quantities. Keep expense recording selected when you want

00:40.953 --> 00:43.261
this purchase included in Expenses.

00:45.400 --> 00:50.767
Review spending by month and currency. Currencies are kept separate without exchange

00:50.767 --> 00:55.815
rate conversion. Pantry updates are a separate choice during receipt review. An

00:55.815 --> 00:59.329
expense alone does not automatically stock your pantry.
